WEBVTT

00:00:06.242 --> 00:00:12.242
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:16.223 --> 00:00:22.223
Click How to Save Money on Data.

00:00:26.328 --> 00:00:32.328
Click Set up skip and chapters.

00:00:36.312 --> 00:00:42.312
Type "0:05" in the Intro start box.

00:00:46.775 --> 00:00:52.775
